    <div class="inst-method-content">
        <section id="scope" class="inst-method-card"><span class="inst-step">01</span><h2>What to report</h2><p>Useful correction reports include factual inaccuracies, stale pricing, incorrect product status, broken or outdated sources, benchmark attribution problems, misleading entity links, duplicated news, or editorial statements that conflict with the evidence shown on the page.</p></section>
        <section id="submit" class="inst-method-card"><span class="inst-step">02</span><h2>How to report a correction</h2><p>Include the affected AI Orbit URL, the specific statement or field you believe is wrong, and the best source available. For pricing, include the plan and billing period. For benchmark issues, identify the benchmark or test. For news, include the original source and explain the relevance problem.</p><div class="inst-actions"><a class="inst-btn primary" href="{{ route('contact', ['topic' => 'data_correction', 'subject' => 'Data correction']) }}">Report a correction <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></a><a class="inst-btn" href="{{ route('submissions.create') }}">Structured data submission</a></div></section>
